window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Aria Todd is the new girl in town. She doesn’t mind the title. In fact, she’s thrilled that she’ll have the chance to start over in a place where nobody knows her. Where nobody can get to her. And where her new neighbor has her peeking out her window regularly. <br> <br> Paxton Fields is Steel Ridge’s resident nice guy. He’s kind to everyone, even the injured and abandoned animals he rescues on occasion.<br> <br> That’s why he catches Aria’s eye, and the pair explore the chemistry between them.<br> <br> But Paxton’s big heart is just a small part of who he is. When it’s necessary to be foreboding, he rises to the occasion.<br> <br> And that’s precisely what happens when he learns that there was a reason for Aria’s recent move to his town. Discovering she’s been coerced from her home, Paxton’s protective instincts kick in. <br> <br> Escaping her past was her plan, but if Paxton can’t find her, Aria may never get to see her future.</p>"; 
